      <widget class="QWidget" name="instructions_tab">
       <attribute name="title">
        <string>Instructions</string>
       </attribute>
       <layout class="QVBoxLayout" name="verticalLayout_3">
        <item>
         <widget class="QScrollArea" name="scrollArea">
          <property name="widgetResizable">
           <bool>true</bool>
          </property>
          <widget class="QWidget" name="scrollAreaWidgetContents">
           <property name="geometry">
            <rect>
             <x>0</x>
             <y>0</y>
             <width>1128</width>
             <height>740</height>
            </rect>
           </property>
           <layout class="QVBoxLayout" name="verticalLayout_2">
            <item>
             <widget class="QLabel" name="tool_label">
              <property name="text">
               <string>&lt;html&gt;&lt;head/&gt;&lt;body&gt;&lt;p&gt;This widget fits the CEST image with either a 5 Lorentzian or a 7 Lorentzian model.  It will also apply a dB0 correction.  The workflow is split into 3 tabs. The steps of the workflow are as follows:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol style=&quot;margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; -qt-list-indent: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;Load &lt;span style=&quot; font-weight:700;&quot;&gt;normalized &lt;/span&gt;CEST file, dB0 file, and CEST offsets.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;Select the model. Load and edit the constraints.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;Run the fit, type a valid filename, and save the images.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Three images will be saved:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 0px; -qt-list-indent: 1;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot; margin-top:12px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;*_fitted (fitted curve)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;*_fitted_params (fit parameters)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:12px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;*_AACID (AACID image)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</string>
              </property>
              <property name="wordWrap">
               <bool>true</bool>
              </property>
             </widget>
            </item>
           </layout>
          </widget>
         </widget>
        </item>
       </layout>
      </widget>
